('pinterest-AW1NeIrNeTnrnQQ3oIXZ0AMz1okT7gh-73u0UDqsNVlYyfSutZBO-ti9AlRltFas2BwCYKpZdZsjQRj_PyKETFk', 'Onitsuka Tiger Tokuten ''Grey White'' US 9.5', 'https://i.pinimg.com/736x/67/f1/1a/67f11a33bcd696686300c2f1b3755741.jpg', 'outerwear', 'santai', 'Pinterest', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/AW1NeIrNeTnrnQQ3oIXZ0AMz1okT7gh-73u0UDqsNVlYyfSutZBO-ti9AlRltFas2BwCYKpZdZsjQRj_PyKETFk/', 'Step into the realm of timeless style with Onitsuka Tiger''s Tokuten ''Grey White''. These iconic sneakers blend vintage aesthetics with contemporary flair. Their supple leather upper in pristine white evokes a classic appeal, while the contrasting grey suede overlays add a touch of sophistication. The signature tiger stripes exude a timeless elegance, making these sneakers an essential for the discerning fashionista seeking both comfort and style. Experience the fusion of tradition and modernity with the Onitsuka Tiger Tokuten ''Grey White''.', 180136, 'Inspirasi Pinterest', 5.0),
('pinterest-1027383733775229462', 'Men''s Streetwear Outfit Ideas', 'https://i.pinimg.com/736x/b5/42/92/b5429233219a13f424d57bee08545ed8.jpg', 'streetwear', 'ngonser', 'Pinterest', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1027383733775229462/', 'Discover modern men''s streetwear outfit ideas featuring relaxed fits, oversized layers, sneakers, neutral colors, and effortless everyday style. Save these streetwear looks for your next outfit inspiration.', 180153, 'Inspirasi Pinterest', 4.8),
