('pinterest-640637115794326613', 'Men''s Cream T-Shirt and Brown Wide-Leg Trousers Outfit', 'https://i.pinimg.com/736x/97/df/4f/97df4f9f50ee024d2c225bffb0f6e966.jpg', 'sporty', 'santai', 'Pinterest', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/640637115794326613/', 'The everyday combination worth repeating. An oversized cream T-shirt, chocolate brown trousers and white sneakers, finished with a black weekender. Save this neutral men''s outfit for casual Fridays, travel days and easy weekends.  AI-created outfit inspiration.', 180204, 'Inspirasi Pinterest', 4.8),
